3Qw8oaz4MlrdkE5N3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI2zx9DIs-FDPteX4J1suP4xjTUovvXc7lWw4U18RM9aQ&oe=6AB7F038"}, "display_name": "ChicKing Dead", "keywords": ["Zombie", "Adventure", "Mech", "Shooting", "Gun"], "long_description": "\u2b50 New updates every week!\nJoin our Discord for the latest news, sneak peeks, and events!\n\ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/chickingdead\n\n# GEAR UP YOUR MECH \nCollect parts, equip Waroids, and power up your MECH. Unlock new abilities, discover powerful combinations, and build the perfect setup for every battle.\n{4695494054018453}\n\n\n# EVERY RUN IS AN ADVENTURE\nFight through ancient ruins, dark tunnels, and hidden dangers to claim valuable loot.\n{1326180492955488}\n\n\n# WIN TOGETHER \nTeam up against powerful bosses or battle for victory in the Cage.\n{1018381533924355}\n\n\n# MAKE IT YOURS\nCustomize, collect, and play your way.\n{1523087202656500}", "short_description": "Welcome to the craziest chicken apocalypse ever. \ud83d\udc14\ud83d\udca5\nFly with your Gearwing, face off against players, and hunt down zombie chickens in wild, fast-paced battles.\nMix and match over 100 high-quality cosmetics to flex your ultimate chicken style and show it off to your friends.\nThis is your fight for fun, chaos, and the crown.\nJoin the community now and get the latest drops, events, and updates. \ud83d\udc51\nThe ChicKing Dead \u2014 where style meets survival."}]}, "developer_name": "QU", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/privavy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/terms-conditions", "publisher_name": "QU", "support_website_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/", "website_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "