106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6eslvBKHR8IQ7kNvwEVNKgF&_nc_oc=AdrQixda5BBOj4brE44fGTg2nXBz0qAoveTcJdDYvClDee3LMLcafIfSRjZyKUZRXQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIEza2tOxX_huzoV9NkR4FFWiZhMe9uCihXk0N4Pm-uiA&oe=6AB7DEE2"}, {"file_name": "CKD_Screenshots_3.png", "id": "898863585793670", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974834_898863595793669_1305649271311713198_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iy4P28YXqtUQ7kNvwFwtP2P&_nc_oc=AdrWd7Hr_Y2L-3IahwKsACP4svcvhkTAhFXVdO7gA9UfsQ3QLWL4A7Qe8F0WWULDh2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIf7zkSvFSZfMhJ_c712gZvTMlnueMBHstvCnPuUTvveA&oe=6AB7E784"}, {"file_name": "CKD_Screenshots_4.png", "id": "604580268631969", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982477_604580275298635_5064479993432018264_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mkahkWQK2ToQ7kNvwHvP-nd&_nc_oc=AdrfWuUKM0zb_ZhT4XqclpX7CndrglKnmhvCOehe0nU0R0OKTsZ03ZmzK9MCxrT_zSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI1dEAKWSQ-yo9zaRXqt59u5vOBAehBVZJzG3DEo6xrlw&oe=6AB7CE12"}, {"file_name": "CKD_Screenshots_5.png", "id": "1722305365278616", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75500287_1722305368611949_4332690201771954895_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IaxQCvnIPhcQ7kNvwGffRox&_nc_oc=AdogCa2EA9S4m6j5q8KGoW83OzWmR1DE_n7SEpl3oa-LT3qvJ8LP0hLKSU5R11I_MN4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKbIs168odSEV8MGTXbx9pCj3Gxvh1RSa0Qlimh0V_NoA&oe=6AB7EAB1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "the ChicKing Dead", "keywords": ["Locomotion", "Zombie", "Tag", "Socialplay", "socialgame"], "long_description": "Welcome to The ChicKing Dead! \ud83d\udc14\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nDive into a dystopian chicken world like no other, where creativity and chaos collide. As a heroic chicken, you must face a zombie virus outbreak while unraveling the sinister plans of a giant corporation. Survival isn't just about fighting\u2014it's about strategy, skill, and a dash of absurd fun.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Unorthodox Gameplay: Soar through the skies with advanced locomotion, pulling off tricks and outsmarting your foes with unconventional tactics.\n\n- Customizable Characters: Express your unique style with an array of wild costumes and cosmetic items.\n- Thrilling Tag-Style Battles: Engage in fast-paced, heart-pounding matches filled with action and creativity.\n- Dynamic Social Interaction: Connect with other players in a lively multi-lobby, share user-generated content, and display your in-game achievements.\n- Expansive Community Focus: Your feedback shapes the future\u2014help us build the ultimate VR experience!\n\nJoin the flock, outwit the undead, and unleash your creativity in this one-of-a-kind VR adventure. The Chicking Dead is more than a game; it\u2019s a community-driven experience that evolves with its players. Are you ready to take flight and turn the tide?", "short_description": "Step into a dystopian chicken world where creativity meets chaos! \nFight to survive against a zombie virus outbreak and the schemes of a giant corporation. \nGlide through the air, master advanced locomotion skills, and turn the tide with unorthodox strategies. \nCustomize unique costumes, compete in thrilling tag-style battles, and showcase your achievements in personal spaces. \nWith a mix of social interaction, user-generated content, and high-paced gameplay, this is a VR adventure like no other"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/privavy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/terms-conditions", "publisher_name": "none", "support_website_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/", "website_url": "https://www.chickingdead.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "conte